270
00:21:49,560 --> 00:21:51,700
That's some sweet music, huh?

271
00:21:51,980 --> 00:21:53,277
Give me some more!

272
00:21:53,360 --> 00:21:56,340
The anguished cries of the lowly!

273
00:21:59,600 --> 00:22:03,080
If you're mad, remember,
this is all your fault!

274
00:22:03,440 --> 00:22:06,616
Should have thought twice
before you wrecked my house!

275
00:22:22,340 --> 00:22:24,160
What's going on, Hold 'em?

276
00:22:24,360 --> 00:22:26,040
You need some help or what?

277
00:22:27,780 --> 00:22:30,400
The food treasure bar just rollin' in!

278
00:22:30,660 --> 00:22:32,366
Let's grab our group, fellas!

279
00:22:33,220 --> 00:22:34,180
I'm starving!

280
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:42,480
I could go for a fief like that.

281
00:22:42,780 --> 00:22:45,486
Those are the supplies
from the Paradise Farm.

282
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:51,340
The water there is clean, so the
food's delicious and safe to eat.

283
00:22:52,320 --> 00:22:53,960
Why is it only for them?

284
00:22:56,540 --> 00:22:57,370
Zoro!

285
00:22:57,480 --> 00:22:58,740
Can you handle that?

286
00:22:59,740 --> 00:23:01,100
Yep. What?

287
00:23:01,760 --> 00:23:03,180
I'll save Tama!

288
00:23:04,140 --> 00:23:05,080
Huh? Huh?

289
00:23:07,960 --> 00:23:11,880
Sorry, short notice, but we're
stealing the food and running.

290
00:23:12,680 --> 00:23:13,510
What?

291
00:23:13,593 --> 00:23:14,423
Just like that?

292
00:23:16,460 --> 00:23:19,017
It's probably going to
piss him off pretty bad,

293
00:23:19,100 --> 00:23:21,700
but it beats smashing his face in, right?

294
00:23:29,880 --> 00:23:30,800
Hey, look!

295
00:23:31,040 --> 00:23:32,120
Hawkins is here!

296
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:34,660
We need your help!

297
00:23:34,780 --> 00:23:36,074
The enemy's too tough!

298
00:23:36,340 --> 00:23:37,811
And what is Holden doing?

299
00:23:38,300 --> 00:23:42,065
He's confronting the intruders
at the plaza in the 4th District!

300
00:23:46,920 --> 00:23:48,880
He's not picking up, it seems.

301
00:23:53,320 --> 00:23:57,026
I'm afraid I'm going to have to
ask you to stop, Basil Hawkins.

302
00:24:06,340 --> 00:24:07,170
Who are you?

303
00:24:07,253 --> 00:24:09,997
He's strong.

304
00:24:10,080 --> 00:24:13,137
Wano is closed off from
the rest of the world.

305
00:24:13,220 --> 00:24:17,117
With no information from the
outside, but Hawkins knows our faces.

306
00:24:17,200 --> 00:24:20,200
I have to erase him.

307
00:24:24,900 --> 00:24:30,740
This next part will be fun for
me, at least not so much for you!

308
00:24:34,920 --> 00:24:37,280
Capture one, but you can kill the rest!

309
00:24:37,840 --> 00:24:39,020
Make it bloody!

310
00:24:39,260 --> 00:24:40,500
Show them no mercy!

311
00:24:45,400 --> 00:24:46,620
Not so fast!

312
00:24:47,660 --> 00:24:52,542
Remember, we have this brat as a hostage,
so I'd put that sword away if I were you.

313
00:25:02,920 --> 00:25:04,337
What have you done?

314
00:25:04,420 --> 00:25:07,497
You'll endanger her, otama!

315
00:25:07,580 --> 00:25:11,097
Whoa, that's cold—decided
you don't need the girl.

316
00:25:11,180 --> 00:25:12,017
Back after all?

317
00:25:12,100 --> 00:25:13,897
Huh, fine by me.

318
00:25:13,980 --> 00:25:18,297
Huh, I'm sure Kamijito's
grateful for the snack.

319
00:25:18,380 --> 00:25:20,797
Go ahead, chew her up!

320
00:25:20,880 --> 00:25:21,710
up

321
00:25:41,100 --> 00:25:42,080
What the?

322
00:25:42,360 --> 00:25:43,700
She disappeared!

323
00:25:49,380 --> 00:25:50,740
That bastard!

324
00:25:50,980 --> 00:25:52,320
I didn't even see him!

325
00:25:52,860 --> 00:25:55,820
Tomijiro, you had one job, you dummy!

326
00:26:21,260 --> 00:26:22,300
You good?

327
00:26:22,500 --> 00:26:23,820
Let's go, okay?

328
00:26:24,560 --> 00:26:25,700
Thank you.

329
00:26:26,620 --> 00:26:28,660
Sorry I kept you waiting so long.

330
00:26:39,600 --> 00:26:43,340
You're about to get a
flaming blade to the face!

331
00:26:50,280 --> 00:26:53,760
No one's ever escaped my
trick mechanism, sword!

332
00:26:54,040 --> 00:26:56,040
And you won't be the first!

333
00:26:58,380 --> 00:26:59,760
Hellfire Ants Go!

334
00:27:05,640 --> 00:27:07,020
Well, that was easy.

335
00:27:07,500 --> 00:27:08,360
Don't scream.

336
00:27:08,560 --> 00:27:09,854
You're coming with me.

337
00:27:11,120 --> 00:27:11,960
Oh, yeah?

338
00:27:12,320 --> 00:27:15,026
If you think I'm lying,
you're gonna be sorry!

339
00:27:21,260 --> 00:27:22,240
I mean it!

340
00:27:22,340 --> 00:27:23,869
Put those swords down now!

341
00:27:30,420 --> 00:27:32,437
You're reasonable after all.

342
00:27:32,520 --> 00:27:35,177
Are you sure about this now?

343
00:27:35,260 --> 00:27:36,357
Stay right there.

344
00:27:36,440 --> 00:27:39,400
Don't move while I beat you to death!

345
00:27:47,240 --> 00:27:48,237
Big lady.

346
00:27:48,320 --> 00:27:50,900
I'm not gonna help you!

347
00:27:57,880 --> 00:28:00,704
Don't you care about her,
you heartless bastard!

348
00:28:07,700 --> 00:28:08,530
Dumb girl!

349
00:28:13,740 --> 00:28:15,360
If you'll excuse me.

350
00:28:18,180 --> 00:28:19,620
What should I do now?

351
00:28:20,020 --> 00:28:22,060
Take care of your side. Right.

352
00:28:26,040 --> 00:28:26,870
Whoa!

353
00:28:40,540 --> 00:28:41,370
Hey!

354
00:29:05,160 --> 00:29:05,990
Hey, dog!

355
00:29:06,220 --> 00:29:07,455
Get over here, quick!

356
00:29:14,820 --> 00:29:16,180
My, what a gentleman.

357
00:29:41,400 --> 00:29:43,341
Hey, what happened to your cheek?

358
00:29:49,480 --> 00:29:51,317
Oh it's no big deal.

359
00:29:51,400 --> 00:29:54,257
It just got yanked on
by some pliers is all.

360
00:29:54,340 --> 00:29:55,477
That guy's dumb.

361
00:29:55,560 --> 00:29:58,520
You can't make Cape
Dongle come out like that.

362
00:30:00,240 --> 00:30:01,540
He what?

363
00:30:03,300 --> 00:30:05,200
Give me a second Tama!

364
00:30:06,380 --> 00:30:08,120
Tired of running away?

365
00:30:13,300 --> 00:30:15,300
It's okay! I'm fine!

366
00:30:15,460 --> 00:30:16,737
You don't need to fight!

367
00:30:16,820 --> 00:30:18,300
Saving me was enough!

368
00:30:21,760 --> 00:30:23,180
Good! Let's go!

369
00:30:24,660 --> 00:30:26,680
Lionfire, it's time to roar!

370
00:30:36,480 --> 00:30:39,240
And now, I'll finish you off!

371
00:30:39,420 --> 00:30:42,560
I've got one more trick
to show, so don't blink!

372
00:30:44,980 --> 00:30:46,940
Come back!

373
00:30:50,660 --> 00:30:52,580
Red Hawk!

374
00:31:12,560 --> 00:31:18,360
I don't know.
